omize their caf\u00e9 with various kitchen tools, interact with diverse customers, and grow stronger by defeating dream monsters. These growth systems enable players to handle more customers more efficiently, adding depth and long-term engagement to the gameplay.</p>","developers":["PepperStones.Inc"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574200/30c6b41771f06d03cd57993139b56f06adc999be/header.jpg?t=1772787100","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 580 / AMD HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-9400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1660S<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3574200/1499570165/3f90669055f4b3be800d78c8c5f1c6e8f35c9570/1753101617/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753589539","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3574200/1499570165/3f90669055f4b3be800d78c8c5f1c6e8f35c9570/1753101617/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753589539","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3574200/1499570165/3f90669055f4b3be800d78c8c5f1c6e8f35c9570/1753101617/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753589539","id":257171828,"name":"1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171828/bc99f008a7cde